config SHM_NPCM
	bool "NPCM host modules share memory driver"
	depends on SOC_FAMILY_NPCM
	help
	  This option enables the host module share memory driver
	  for NPCM SoCs.
	  Say y if you wish to access host modules
	  on NPCM SMC.
